# Read a whole knowledge base on one board > Reading one
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/read-a-board.md#L66
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

# One reading, from the whole board down to one panel's inside.
whole::a Read a board ::e

open::a Open the board ::e
  --> find::a Find a node ::e
  --> walk::a Walk to the next usage ::e
open, find, walk --::P--> whole

you::a Board reader --> open, find, walk
page::a the board page --> open
badge::a the 3/7 badge --> find, walk
anch::a the anchor behind it --> walk
pnl::a the landing's panel --> walk

page --> board page ::c
badge --> board part ::c
anch --> anchor ::c
pnl --> panel ::c
you --> Reader ::c
